WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.927
Panther and Jane ran out of Dot's and didn't stop until they got to the game store.

2
00:00:05.928 --> 00:00:12.148
"Are the police coming?" gasped Jane.

3
00:00:12.149 --> 00:00:14.183
Panther looked around.

4
00:00:14.184 --> 00:00:16.503
"I don't think so.

5
00:00:16.504 --> 00:00:20.684
But we should find the boys and leave."

6
00:00:20.685 --> 00:00:22.785
They didn't have to look long.

7
00:00:22.786 --> 00:00:28.608
At that moment, Cy and Bobby came rushing out of the door of the game

8
00:00:28.609 --> 00:00:33.525
store. Behind them, the clerk was waving a fist and shouting

9
00:00:33.526 --> 00:00:39.288
threats. With an exchange of helpless looks, the children began running down the

10
00:00:39.289 --> 00:00:43.815
street. "I have to rest," Panther shouted after a few

11
00:00:43.816 --> 00:00:46.439
minutes. "Can we please

12
00:00:46.440 --> 00:00:51.383
stop?" Cy led the children to a park where they collapsed on some

13
00:00:51.384 --> 00:00:55.845
benches. They sat for a while catching their

14
00:00:55.846 --> 00:00:57.634
breath. "Did you buy your

15
00:00:57.635 --> 00:01:00.296
games?" Panther asked, her voice calmer

16
00:01:00.297 --> 00:01:04.303
now. Cy explained to his sisters what had

17
00:01:04.304 --> 00:01:06.282
happened. Bobby did not say a

18
00:01:06.283 --> 00:01:08.968
word. He was still mad at

19
00:01:08.969 --> 00:01:13.090
Cy. Then Panther told her brothers what had happened at

20
00:01:13.091 --> 00:01:20.217
Dot's. "We might have been rich, but those gold coins did nothing good for us," concluded

21
00:01:20.218 --> 00:01:22.875
Cy. Everyone

22
00:01:22.876 --> 00:01:28.576
agreed. "And I acted very badly, Jane," said Panther. "I'm

23
00:01:28.577 --> 00:01:32.777
sorry." "I'm sorry, too, Panther," said

24
00:01:32.778 --> 00:01:36.511
Jane. "By the way, you did look pretty in that

25
00:01:36.512 --> 00:01:40.018
dress." Jane hugged her

26
00:01:40.019 --> 00:01:45.239
sister. "Hey, the ice cream man is here!" Cy called, jumping

27
00:01:45.240 --> 00:01:50.612
up. He ran toward an ice cream truck that was playing music as it

28
00:01:50.613 --> 00:01:58.488
approached. His sisters went with him, but Bobby followed behind, dragging his

29
00:01:58.489 --> 00:02:00.830
feet. "My treat," offered

30
00:02:00.831 --> 00:02:04.034
Cy. "So have whatever you

31
00:02:04.035 --> 00:02:11.008
want." Panther and Jane both chose strawberry with a scoop of chocolate, and Cy got vanilla caramel.

32
00:02:11.009 --> 00:02:13.797
"Hey, Bobby," called out Cy.

33
00:02:13.798 --> 00:02:17.752
"Why don't you get chocolate marshmallow?"

34
00:02:17.753 --> 00:02:20.018
"I don't want anything.

35
00:02:20.019 --> 00:02:24.991
And stop telling me what to do!" Bobby shouted back.

36
00:02:24.992 --> 00:02:27.485
The other children looked at each other.

37
00:02:27.486 --> 00:02:30.719
"He's still mad at me," shrugged Cy.

38
00:02:30.720 --> 00:02:34.108
"He'll get over it."

39
00:02:34.109 --> 00:02:39.347
Cy handed the ice cream man two gold coins that he had left in his pocket.

40
00:02:39.348 --> 00:02:44.628
The man shook his head and said, "What's this? Play money?"

41
00:02:44.629 --> 00:02:49.075
Cy gave the man a weary smile and took out his wallet.

42
00:02:49.076 --> 00:02:54.160
He paid for the ice cream with his own money.

43
00:02:54.161 --> 00:02:59.451
The sun had just begun to set when the children headed for home.

44
00:02:59.452 --> 00:03:07.118
Soon the day's wish to be rich would end, and everything would be the same as it had been before.

45
00:03:07.119 --> 00:03:10.806
The next morning, Bobby was the first to wake up.

46
00:03:10.807 --> 00:03:16.705
He dressed quietly and snuck out of the house just as the sun began to rise.

47
00:03:16.706 --> 00:03:22.490
Today was Bobby's turn to make a wish, and he knew exactly what he wanted.

48
00:03:22.491 --> 00:03:27.732
He walked through the forest and found the old well.

49
00:03:27.733 --> 00:03:34.031
"Huey, Huey!" Bobby called impatiently as he pulled the bucket up from the well.

50
00:03:34.032 --> 00:03:37.672
Huey slowly poked his head out of his shell.

51
00:03:37.673 --> 00:03:40.264
He looked sleepily at Bobby.

52
00:03:40.265 --> 00:03:43.030
"Do you know what time it is?"

53
00:03:43.031 --> 00:03:48.496
"I want to make a wish," Bobby said, ignoring him.

54
00:03:48.497 --> 00:03:52.870
"Where are the others?" Huey asked, looking around.

55
00:03:52.871 --> 00:03:54.083
"It doesn't matter.

56
00:03:54.084 --> 00:03:57.582
Today it's my turn," Bobby answered hastily.

57
00:03:57.583 --> 00:04:00.045
Huey glanced at him curiously.

58
00:04:00.046 --> 00:04:04.168
"Okay, then. What is your wish?"

59
00:04:04.169 --> 00:04:12.326
Bobby closed his eyes and said, "I wish I was an only child."

